  "name": "Venomancer: Exposed Flesh has a shared 1 s internal cooldown (COA-5796)",
  "contract": [
    "Exposed Flesh's passive (92144, helper 805098, ProcChance 50) granted a stack of Exposed Flesh 805095 on every",
    "incoming non-periodic hit that won the 50% roll, so a crowd of attackers stacked it almost at once. On Ascension it",
    "has an internal cooldown of about 1 s shared by every attacker. Chance(player, 805098, 1000) now schedules a 1000 ms",
    "per-player cooldown. Eight aggressive level 80 gnolls swing for 6 s (about 24 hits): without the",
    "cooldown Exposed Flesh reaches its 10-stack cap, with it at most 7 stacks (one per second at worst)."
  ],
